        "A conflict passes only if unrelated, or accepted with matching path, hash and impact"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Failure",
      "items": [
        "Files are staged and renamed; a commit error restores backups and removes new files",
        "Cancellation keeps applied files and lists the rest; a reload failure is reported, not rolled back",
        "A failed sandbox runtime install is non-fatal: the result lists it as Incomplete"
